12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Midori, thank you. I'll look into the room differences.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I'm going to check the statements. We can't guess our way through a budget.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I'll look into how other houses do their settling.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
