35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It seems a fixed rate allows people to live without fear, though some may over-use.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,The logs show we've had many late payments and arguments over changing amounts.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,I found out that some rooms use four times more power than others.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"The bills swing wildly between summer and winter, and meters are quite expensive to install.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The templates and other houses... they seem to take a lot of time and effort to manage.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, that difference in usage explains why some of us feel uneasy.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, if the bills vary that much, no wonder people are stressed about the totals.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Servas, yes, and some rooms are just colder because of the sun.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"Exactly. But paying 34,000 yen per room for meters is a huge upfront cost.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I don't want to spend my whole evening doing manual logs like those other houses.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,We must avoid a system where people suffer in the cold to save money.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,We need something simple. The current confusion is damaging our harmony.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"If some use more, maybe they should pay more? But it's not their fault where the room is.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"A flat share is easiest, but the seasonal spikes are what kill the budget.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, would a flat share be easier to calculate than the other options?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us consider the options presented to us now.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. Let's see which one balances fairness with peace.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,I just want it to be fair for everyone.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,I want something that doesn't surprise me with a huge bill in February.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,And something that doesn't take hours to organize.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
